ISET<x>:<NR2>    Sets the value of current.VSET<x>:<NR2>    Sets the value of voltage.                 x:1=CH1,2=CH2 (4303:3=CH3,4=CH4)ISET<x>?         Return the value of current.VSET<x>?         Return the value of voltage.IOUT<x>?         Returns actual output current.VOUT<x>?         Returns actual output voltage.TRACK<NR1>       Sets the output of the power supply working on independent or tracking mode.BAUD<NR1>        Sets the baud rate.RCL<NR1>         Recall the setting data from the memory which previous saved.SAV<NR1>         Saves the setting data to memory.BEEP<Boolean>    Sets the beep state on or off.OUT<Boolean>     Sets the output state on or off.LOCAL            Return to lacal mode.REMOTE           Into remote mode.(only for local mode)*IDN?            Returns instrument identification.ERR?             Returns instrument error messages.STATUS?          Returns the power supply state.
